m).\nThe gnoll's spiked leather bracer (`gnoll.bbmodel`: `gear_bracer_left`), redrawn to fit warrior_base: one bracer with its spike on the left forearm (`arm_lower_l`) only. Both faces are resampled from the gnoll's own texture at 1 px per unit. Same bones and pivots as warrior_base. Patch 7 loot.\n"}